window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>“Have you found your new beginning yet?” Peace in Abra’am has ended. Power has switched hands. Though the leaders of Xenith and Sadie fight to maintain order, resistance stirs, proving sometimes those who fight the hardest do so without crowns. It’s unclear who works to heal the world and who profits from its pain. The War of Fire created an illusion of order. For many, the illusion has shattered.</p> <p></p> <p>But the past does not have to shape the future. From the ashes, something better can rise.</p>"; 
